cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ML4T Agent Skills
message: >-
  If you use these skills in your work, please cite both this
  repository and the book the method comes from.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Stefan
    family-names: Jansen
    email: pm@ml4trading.io
    website: 'https://ml4trading.io'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/ml4t/skills'
url: 'https://ml4trading.io'
abstract: >-
  61 standalone agent skills that teach AI coding assistants the
  Machine Learning for Trading workflow: leakage-safe quant ML,
  point-in-time data handling, purged cross-validation, cost-aware
  backtesting, and autonomous research workflows. Each skill is a
  Markdown file pairing a wrong pattern with the correct one.
keywords:
